{"id":"vantaa","name":"万塔","en":"Vantaa","country":"Finland","lat":60.2944,"lng":25.0403,"dek":"机场之城，河畔的日常","history":"万塔在很长一段时间里只是赫尔辛基北边的一片乡野，万塔河从中间流过，沿岸散落着农庄与磨坊。它没有中世纪商埠的城墙，也没有主教座堂式的中心，城市的轮廓是慢慢从土地里长出来的。\n\n1972年，万塔成为集镇，两年后获得城市资格。这个时间点在芬兰的城市里算晚的，彼时它仍与赫尔辛基、埃斯波、考尼艾宁一起，被视作首都圈的一部分，而非独立的面孔。\n\n真正改变万塔的是机场。赫尔辛基-万塔机场坐落于此，成为芬兰最大的航空门户，城市也因此被更多人先认识于跑道与航站楼，然后才是河流与街区。","culture":"万塔是双语市镇，芬兰语和瑞典语同为官方语言，日常里以芬兰语为主。这里的居民构成比其他芬兰城市更杂，爱沙尼亚人等移民群体在此定居，使城市有一种通行者与定居者混杂的气质。\n\n赫乌雷卡科学中心是这种气质的一个注脚。它不以历史建筑取胜，而是把科学做成可以动手的场所，吸引着首都圈的家庭与学校。万塔河则仍是城市的底色，河岸的步道与旧工业痕迹，提醒人们这里曾以水为生。","pull":"先有机场，后有城市。","sights":[{"name":"赫尔辛基-万塔机场","orig":"Helsinki-Vantaa lentoasema","intro":"芬兰最大的航空门户，也是万塔最常被人经过的地方。航站楼不算张扬，却承担着连接芬兰与世界的角色。对旅行者而言，它往往是对这座城市的第一印象，也是最后一瞥。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Helsinki-Vantaa_Airport_4.jpg/960px-Helsinki-Vantaa_Airport_4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":644},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B5%AB%E5%B0%94%E8%BE%9B%E5%9F%BA-%E4%B8%87%E5%A1%94%E6%9C%BA%E5%9C%BA"},{"name":"赫乌雷卡科学中心","orig":"Heureka","intro":"位于万塔的科学中心，以互动展览为主，适合带孩子消磨半天。馆内外的展项强调动手与体验，而非陈列说明。它在芬兰科普场所中知名度很高，也是本地人熟悉的周末去处。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Heureka.jpg/960px-Heureka.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heureka"},{"name":"万塔河","orig":"Vantaanjoki","intro":"流经万塔的河流，城市因它得名。河岸有步道与绿地，沿线可见旧磨坊和工业时代的痕迹。它不壮阔，却是理解万塔从乡野走向城市的一条线索，适合慢慢走。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Vantaanjoki_june2008.JPG/960px-Vantaanjoki_june2008.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%90%AC%E5%A1%94%E6%B2%B3"},{"name":"芬兰航空博物馆","orig":"Suomen ilmailumuseo","intro":"靠近机场的航空主题博物馆，收藏芬兰民航与军用航空的实物与档案。展陈朴素，适合对飞行器与航空史有兴趣的人。它与机场的位置关系，本身也说明了万塔与航空的牵连。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/FinnishAviationMuseumBuilding.jpg/960px-FinnishAviationMuseumBuilding.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":612},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%AC%E5%85%B0%E8%88%AA%E7%A9%BA%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86"},{"name":"米卡·哈基宁","orig":"Mika Häkkinen","intro":"出生于万塔的一级方程式赛车手，曾两度获得世界冠军。他的名字在芬兰赛车史上占有一席，也让万塔在体育记忆里留下一个坐标。对车迷而言，这是城市之外的一层关联。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Mika_H%C3%A4kkinen_at_the_2026_Adelaide_Motorsport_Festival_%28028A6887%29.jpg/960px-Mika_H%C3%A4kkinen_at_the_2026_Adelaide_Motorsport_Festival_%28028A6887%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1440},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%B1%B3%E9%AB%98%C2%B7%E5%A4%8F%E5%81%A5%E5%80%AB"}],"foods":[{"name":"卡累利阿派","orig":"karjalanpiirakka","intro":"黑麦皮包裹米糊或土豆的烤制点心，是芬兰日常餐桌上的常客。吃时常抹一层蛋黄油，配咖啡或汤。万塔的面包房与超市都能买到，适合当早餐或路上充饥。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Karjalanpiirakka-20060227.jpg/960px-Karjalanpiirakka-20060227.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":707},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karelian_pasty"},{"name":"三文鱼汤","orig":"lohikeitto","intro":"以三文鱼、土豆和奶油煮成的浓汤，芬兰沿海与湖区都常见。汤色乳白，味道温和，常配黑麦面包。万塔的午餐餐馆在秋冬常供应这一道，暖胃也管饱。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Lohikeitto.jpg/960px-Lohikeitto.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":null},{"name":"肉桂卷","orig":"korvapuusti","intro":"芬兰咖啡桌上的经典甜点，面团卷肉桂糖后烤成，形状像一只拧起的耳朵。配黑咖啡是本地习惯。万塔的咖啡馆与超市烘焙区都能找到，适合下午歇脚时吃一个。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Kanelbulle.jpg/960px-Kanelbulle.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":null},{"name":"黑麦面包","orig":"ruisleipä","intro":"芬兰主食面包，用黑麦发酵烤成，质地紧实，酸味明显。常切片配汤、黄油或奶酪。万塔的市集与面包房有售，是理解当地饮食最直接的一样东西。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Sourdough_rye_with_walnuts.jpg/960px-Sourdough_rye_with_walnuts.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":618},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BB%91%E9%BA%A6%E9%9D%A2%E5%8C%85"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Helsinki-vantaa_aerial.jpg/1280px-Helsinki-vantaa_aerial.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":960},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/63/Tikkurila_Old_Railway_Station.jpg/1280px-Tikkurila_Old_Railway_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":964}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[24.7462404,60.3222773],[24.7609248,60.3253743],[24.771801,60.2992165],[24.7649365,60.2712464],[24.7654861,60.270065],[24.7699768,60.2683345],[24.7671623,60.2663036],[24.7677636,60.2636786],[24.7740363,60.257415],[24.7847561,60.2415059],[24.8336845,60.2546667],[24.834732,60.2584996],[24.8368518,60.2590294],[24.8578164,60.253608],[24.8624913,60.2531433],[24.8643084,60.2539152],[24.8678739,60.2523805],[24.872433,60.2541514],[24.8772516,60.2603098],[24.8914714,60.2664204],[24.8928329,60.2685353],[24.9098735,60.2708352],[24.9245784,60.2748149],[24.9319642,60.2750622],[24.9455349,60.2783909],[24.9525046,60.2781911],[24.9535465,60.2769501],[24.9563403,60.2762969],[24.9558952,60.2727928],[24.9606555,60.2681395],[24.9708365,60.2646914],[24.9752963,60.2648386],[24.9757516,60.2665156],[24.9780856,60.2677774],[24.9755367,60.2697245],[24.9771629,60.271734],[24.9774634,60.2738576],[24.980729,60.2758926],[24.9808049,60.2773645],[24.9824538,60.2791301],[24.9897567,60.2797843],[24.9956691,60.2814264],[25.0007041,60.2865557],[25.0059725,60.2861348],[25.0087393,60.2877523],[25.0120814,60.2873456],[25.015933,60.288932],[25.0209862,60.